'''Micro Fighters''' (ミクロファイター, ''Mikuro Faitā'', '''Micro Fighter''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 10.7 Update|Version 10.7]].

==Effect==
"Strong" Effect UP (Sm): The effect of this ability is increased by 10%.

